    "JIT and StikDebug" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "JIT 和 StikDebug"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JIT is off" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "JIT 还没开"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JIT is on" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "JIT 已开启"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JIT makes systems run 5 to 10 times faster. iPhone doesn't give sideloaded apps JIT directly; the open-source StikDebug provides it on the phone.\nOne-time setup: sideload StikDebug, install LocalDevVPN from the App Store, and follow StikDebug's instructions to create a pairing file on a computer once and import it into StikDebug.\nEach time after that: open LocalDevVPN, come back to this app and tap a system. The app switches to StikDebug, which turns on JIT, then comes back and boots. StikDebug may ask you to confirm once; just confirm." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "JIT 让系统快 5 到 10 倍。iPhone 不直接给侧载 App 开 JIT，要靠开源的 StikDebug 在手机上给。\n一次性准备：侧载装好 StikDebug；从 App Store 装 LocalDevVPN；照 StikDebug 的说明在电脑上生成一次配对文件、导入 StikDebug。\n以后每次：打开 LocalDevVPN，回到本 App 点系统，会自动跳到 StikDebug，开好 JIT 后回来开机。StikDebug 可能会弹一次确认，点确认即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JIT: StikDebug is preparing the code region; the screen will pause briefly" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "JIT：StikDebug 在准备代码区，画面会停一下"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "JIT: waiting for the debugger to attach (up to 120 s)…" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "JIT：等待调试器挂上（最多 120 秒）…"
          }
        }
      }
    },
