    },
    "Only one system can run at a time, and switching systems means reopening the app. After tapping “Close App”, tap this app's icon on the Home Screen again (or swipe it away in the app switcher and reopen it), and %@ will boot with the interpreter." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次只能开一个系统，换系统要重新打开 App。点「关闭 App」后，在主屏幕上再点一次本 App 的图标（或者从多任务里划掉再打开），就会直接用解释器开 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only one system can run at a time. Switching systems restarts the app." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次只能开一个系统，换系统时 App 会重新启动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Only one system can run at a time. The app will switch to StikDebug to turn on JIT, then come back and boot this one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一次只能开一个系统。App 会跳到 StikDebug 开 JIT，再自动回来开这台。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
