          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Power button" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电源键"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Put a .ctpack device pack in this app's Documents. The app imports it automatically and deletes the pack when done.\n· Mac: connect the iPhone with a cable, select it in Finder, open Files, and drag the pack onto this app.\n· On the phone: in the Files app, open this app's folder under On My iPhone and move the pack into the import folder (or straight into the app's folder).\nStay on this page to watch the progress." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "把 .ctpack 设备包放进本 App 的文稿，App 会自动导入，导入完删掉包。\n· Mac：插线后在 Finder 里选中这台 iPhone，打开「文件」，把包拖到本 App 上。\n· 手机上：在「文件」App 里打开「我的 iPhone」中本 App 的文件夹，把包移进 import 文件夹（或直接放进来）。\n导入时留在这一页可以看进度。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Resume" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "继续"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Running" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "运行中"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Settings" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Show or hide status" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "显示或隐藏运行状态"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shut down (%d); log in logs/%@/qemu.log" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已关机（%d），记录在 logs/%@/qemu.log"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shut down. Tap here to boot again (the app will restart)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已关机。点这里重新开机（App 会重启）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Shut down. To boot again, reopen the app and tap a system below." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已关机。再开一次要重新打开 App，点下面的系统即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Something Went Wrong" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "出错了"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Source Code" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "源代码"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug didn't turn on JIT for this app. Make sure LocalDevVPN is on and a pairing file is imported in StikDebug, then try again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "StikDebug 没有给本 App 开 JIT。请确认 LocalDevVPN 开着、StikDebug 里导入过配对文件，再试一次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "StikDebug wasn't found, so JIT isn't available." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "没找到 StikDebug，拿不到 JIT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch System" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "换系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switch to %@?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "换成 %@？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Switching systems goes through StikDebug again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "换系统时会再经 StikDebug 开一次。"
          }
