    },
    "Systems" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "选择系统"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Systems & Storage" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "系统和存储"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Systems can only boot with the interpreter, which is very slow. Tap here to see how to install it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "只能用解释器开机，会很慢。点这里看怎么装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap a system to boot it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点系统直接开机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap one to delete it. Deleting removes all of its data and can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点一台可以删除它。删除会删掉这台的全部数据，不能恢复。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tapping a system switches to StikDebug to turn it on, then comes back and boots. Open LocalDevVPN first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "点系统后会跳到 StikDebug 开启，开好自动回来开机。要先打开 LocalDevVPN。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The ctpack ended early" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ctpack 提前结束"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The current system is using JIT" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "当前系统在用 JIT"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The developer hasn't added a donation page yet. Check back in a few versions. Thanks for wanting to help!" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开发者还没填捐赠页的地址，过几个版本再来看看。谢谢你愿意支持！"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The emulator core is Sam Henri Gold's qemu-ios, and device creation comes from his Light Touch; JIT comes from StikDebug (installed separately). QEMU statically links GLib, PCRE2, proxy-libintl, pixman, libslirp, OpenSSL, Nettle, and libffi." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "模拟器核心是 Sam Henri Gold 的 qemu-ios，设备制作来自他的 Light Touch；JIT 靠 StikDebug（单独安装）。QEMU 里静态链接了 GLib、PCRE2、proxy-libintl、pixman、libslirp、OpenSSL、Nettle、libffi。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The running %@ will be shut down, like pulling the battery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "正在运行的 %@ 会被关掉，相当于直接拔电池。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This project is not affiliated with Apple. iPhone, iPod touch, iPad, and iOS are trademarks of Apple Inc., used here only to describe which models and systems can be emulated. The app does not include any Apple system files." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "本项目和 Apple 没有关系。iPhone、iPod touch、iPad、iOS 是 Apple Inc. 的商标，这里只用来说明能模拟哪些机型和系统。App 不附带任何苹果的系统文件。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This system and all of its data (%@) will be deleted. This can't be undone; to use it again, import it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台的系统和里面的全部数据（%@）都会删掉，不能恢复。要再用得重新导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This system and all of its data will be deleted. This can't be undone; to use it again, import it again." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这台的系统和里面的全部数据都会删掉，不能恢复。要再用得重新导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
