    "Writing %@ failed: errno %d" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "写 %@ 失败：errno %d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also boot with the interpreter, but iOS 7 is barely usable that way." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "也可以用解释器开机，但 iOS 7 在解释器下基本不能用。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "You can also boot with the interpreter, but it's much slower: about 1 minute to the lock screen for iPhone OS 3 and about 2 minutes for iOS 6, and it feels sluggish." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "也可以用解释器开机，但会慢很多：iPhone OS 3 约 1 分钟、iOS 6 约 2 分钟才到锁屏，用起来也卡。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "dlopen %@ failed: %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "dlopen %@ 失败：%@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "ftruncate %@: errno %d" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ftruncate %@：errno %d"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iOS 8 needs a model with an A5 or A6 chip (iPod touch 5th generation, iPhone 5), and devices for this version aren't ready yet, so it can't run for now. Once it's supported, imported systems will appear here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iOS 8 要在 A5、A6 芯片的机型（iPod touch 第 5 代、iPhone 5）上跑，这个版本的设备还没做好，所以暂时开不了。以后支持了，导入后会出现在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPad (1st generation)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPad（初代）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone (1st generation)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPhone（初代）"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "iPhone OS 1 runs only on the original iPhone and the iPod touch (1st generation), which this app doesn't support yet, so it can't run for now. Once they're supported, imported systems will appear here." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iPhone OS 1 只能跑在初代 iPhone 和 iPod touch（第 1 代）上，这两种机型本 App 还没支持，所以暂时开不了。以后支持了，导入后会出现在这里。"
          }
